    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMASH BEAR SUPPORTS KEYBOARD INPUT BUT IS BEST PLAYED WITH A CONTROLLER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, dash, and smash through the human settlements, and unleash the rage of Smash Bear in this action roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash Bear runs are high-octane sessions. A successful run can be completed in less than 10 minutes without dying, but you WILL die a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827880/extras/104c331789562314412b08b9ca9328a2.poster.avif?t=1738134790\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827880/extras/104c331789562314412b08b9ca9328a2.webm?t=1738134790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827880/extras/104c331789562314412b08b9ca9328a2.mp4?t=1738134790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827880/extras/ce6248cbf0190dc59e250747ab99867b.avif?t=1738134790\" width=400 height=104 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Short, action-packed, randomly generated runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Permadeath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Destructible environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Difficult.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > High scores and leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Different bears with different play styles.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO romancing characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
